'''Silnar''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{zone|Cliffside Veins}} who introduces the player to the [[Cult of the Fallen Star]]. Upon talking to them while wearing a {{Item|Fallen Star Helmet}}, they give the player a {{Item|Fallen Star Lozenge}}.

